  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut capsicum and carrot into bite-sized chunks. <br>• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil. <br>• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf458e0e4e3eb769fd4c0/step-07da8500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. <br>• Pat haloumi dry, then cut into 1cm-thick slices (you should get 3 pieces per person).<br>• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Remove pan from heat, add the honey and a splash of water and turn haloumi to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf458e0e4e3eb769fd4c0/step-d684d110.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, combine the water and stock powder in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil. <br>• Add couscous and the butter and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat. <br>• Set aside until the water has absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with fork.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf458e0e4e3eb769fd4c0/step-ffe86920.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add the roasted veggies and baby spinach to the couscous. Toss to coat. Season to taste. <br>• Divide roast veggie couscous and haloumi between bowls. <br>• Top with yoghurt to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf458e0e4e3eb769fd4c0/step-4d3f4d30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
